lass=\"citation\" data-id=\"9423729\"><a href=\"/opinion/107715/witherspoon-v-illinois/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Witherspoon v. Illinois\">391 U. S. 510</a></span> (1968); <em>Boulden </em>v. <em>Holman, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9423981\"><a href=\"/opinion/107893/boulden-v-holman/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Boulden v. Holman\">394 U. S. 478</a></span> (1969); and <em>Maxwell </em>v. <em>Bishop, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9424284\"><a href=\"/opinion/108155/maxwell-v-bishop/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Maxwell v. Bishop\">398 U. S. 262</a></span> (1970).</p>\n<judges id=\"AR2B\">Mr. Justice Black dissents.</judges>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}